  "details": "I recognise that this is not a very important feature and can technically be done with a custom parameter but it would be nice to have a parameter synced to whether streamer mode is enabled or not in the settings.\nThis could allow you to create some kind of animation to indicate to people in the world if you are streaming such as a recording icon or twitch logo for example and/or disable features on your avatar that are not desirable to have on streaming platforms such as DMCA audio sources among other things.",
